'''Wisps''' are [[orbital familiar]]s that are created by the {{i|Book of Virtues}}. This article lays out the effects and stats of the wisps Isaac can create, mostly covering {{i|Book of Virtues}} synergies.

== Unique Wisps ==
Descriptions for the following wisp stats:
* Item: The item that spawns the following wisp. {{i|Everything Jar}}, {{i|Esau Jr.}}, {{i|Mom's Box}}, {{i|Pandora's Box}}, {{i|R Key}}, and {{i|Death Certificate}} only spawn normal wisps, and have no unique effects.
* Orbit: The ring around Isaac the wisp occupies. The Inner ring can hold 6 wisps, the Center ring can hold 8 wisps, and the Outer ring can hold 12 wisps. Wisps that don't orbit Isaac will count as “other” and have their unique behavior in the notes.
* HP: The amount of hits the wisp can take before being destroyed. Contact damage and explosions count as two hits taken. Wisps are immune to damage if Isaac is [[Temporary Buffs|Shielded/Invulnerable]] or under the effects of {{i|Gnawed Leaf}}. Invulnerability frames from taking damage do not count.
* Tear Damage: The damage the wisp's tears do. All wisps deal an additional +0.1 tear damage for every floor deeper into the game Isaac is. Note that the contact damage the wisps deal is 2x Isaac's damage per tick (4x Isaac's damage per second) and is unaffected by the wisp type, with a few exceptions.
** {{i|BFFS!}} will double the base damage, contact damage, and damage scaling per floor of the wisps, and {{t|Forgotten Lullaby}} will double their fire rate.
* Tear Delay: The number of frames the wisp has to wait between firing tears. 30 frames equals one second.
* Tear Effects: Any special tear effects/modifiers the wisp's tears have, such as [[Tear Effects|Homing]] or [[Status Effects|Poison]], and the chance of that effect occurring if it is a chance.
* Notes: Any other effects the wisp has that are worth noting.

