== Other Interactions ==
The following items don't have unique wisps when used with {{i|Book of Virtues}}, and instead have other effects:
* {{i|Alabaster Box}}: Spawns 8 normal wisps when used.
* {{i|The Book of Sin}}: Spawns the wisp of {{i|Yum Heart}}, {{i|Mom's Bottle of Pills}}, {{i|Deck of Cards}}, {{i|Mr. Boom}}, {{i|Portable Slot}} (Coin wisp, x3), {{i|Bob's Rotten Head}}, {{i|Anarchist Cookbook}}, or {{i|Shoop da Whoop!}}. Shoop Da Whoop wisps will not fire lasers when Book of Sin is used. The wisp given is independent of the pickup generated.
* {{i|Breath of Life}}: Spawns a normal wisp if Isaac takes damage from using it.
* {{i|Clicker}}/{{i|Friend Finder}}: Spawns a random wisp.
* {{i|D infinity}}: Spawns a normal wisp, along with the appropriate extra wisp of the die it's mimicking if the conditions for it are met.
* {{i|D4}}/{{i|D100}}: Removes all of Isaac's wisps and gives him one random wisp for every two items rerolled. Book of Virtues will not be rerolled in the process.
* {{i|Dead Sea Scrolls}}/{{i|Metronome}}: The wisp spawned will be based on the item it mimicked.
* {{i|Mystery Gift}}: Spawns a random wisp. For the rest of the run, a random wisp spawns after clearing a room if the one given by the item was destroyed, including the replacement wisps given by this effect.
* {{i|Eden's Soul}}: Spawns a random wisp. For the rest of the run, the wisp turns into a new random wisp after clearing a room, regardless of if the wisp was destroyed or not. If the wisp has no room to spawn, then it doesn't, but it continues to attempt to spawn after every room clear.
* {{i|Genesis}}: Replaces all of Isaac's wisps with 3 normal wisps, in addition to its other effects.
* {{i|Jar of Wisps}}: The number of wisps spawned is doubled and then increased by 1.
* {{i|Lemegeton}}: Lets Lemegeton's wisps shoot homing tears once per second that deal 3 damage.
* {{i|Portable Slot}}: Gives the wisps of the following items depending on the reward:
** Coin: Portable Slot (see wisps section above)
*** Two wisps are spawned if Portable Slot gives 2 coins.
** Heart: {{i|Yum Heart}}
** Bomb:{{i| Mr. Boom}}
** Key: {{i|Dad's Key}}
** Pill: {{i|Mom's Bottle of Pills}}
** Black Fly: Nothing
** Pretty Fly: {{i|Guppy's Head}} (x2-4)
* {{i|Spindown Dice}}: Spawns an extra wisp and rerolls all of Isaac's wisps. All of the wisps will reroll into the same type of wisp.
* {{i|Vade Retro}}: Ghosts created by enemies very slowly move and shoot tears in the same direction Isaac is shooting. The ghosts' tears deal 3.5 damage, and are fired once every second. No wisps are created when using Vade Retro. The wisps' damage are unaffected by the enemy they spawned from.
* {{i|Void}}: Spawns the wisps of all the active items it's absorbed. Spawns no wisps by itself. Using Void on Book of Virtues will give stat upgrades instead of its normal effect, as Book of Virtues is considered a passive item.

